        <EquippedGear>
          <Name>Standard</Name>
          <Trinket>
            <NoAutoUpdate/>
            <UserSetsLevel/>
            <Name>Gem of Many Facets</Name>
            <Icon>Trinket_29a</Icon>
            <Description>From this chain hangs a gem that is very finely cut, giving it countless glittering faces. It can take the place of various other items for the purpose of activating certain set bonuses.

This item will randomly choose from available set bonuses whenever it is
re-acquired or upgraded to a higher level version. This item is also keyed
for Cannith Crafting, and may be Disjuncted so that it can be crafted upon.
Note that upgrading this item to a higher level version through Epic or Legendary
Crafting will destroy what has been Cannith Crafted on it, and will also re-roll
available set bonuses.</Description>
            <DropLocation>The Chronoscope, and The Chronoscope (Legendary), optional chests</DropLocation>
            <MinLevel>5</MinLevel>
            <EquipmentSlot>
              <Trinket/>
            </EquipmentSlot>
            <Material>Gem (material)</Material>
            <ItemAugment>
              <Type>Set Bonus 1</Type>
              <Augment>
                <Name>Might of the Abishai</Name>
                <Description>Might of the Abishai</Description>
                <MinLevel>5</MinLevel>
